{"unit_id":"Vincent-chk__dsh-plugin-auxiliary-chat#feature-1","repo":"Vincent-chk/dsh-plugin-auxiliary-chat","commit":"55b58eb2646b7d95571956d83534f4c81ca4613f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auxiliary Chat 的功能「独立辅助会话」：创建新的辅助 session，并在其自身会话中初始化；可恢复已登记的会话。 通过辅助会话初始化、上下文镜像或客户端拖放路由触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/create.ts:67-120"]}
{"unit_id":"Vincent-chk__dsh-plugin-auxiliary-chat#feature-2","repo":"Vincent-chk/dsh-plugin-auxiliary-chat","commit":"55b58eb2646b7d95571956d83534f4c81ca4613f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auxiliary Chat 的功能「主会话上下文镜像」：创建时将主会话内容通过辅助 agent 的提示上下文传递，并支持完整记录预算及摘要回退。 通过辅助会话初始化、上下文镜像或客户端拖放路由触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/mirror.ts:44-64","src/host/apply.ts:73-80"]}
